    "Memoir builds the archive on this device and hands it to you; nothing is uploaded. The copy waiting here is removed when you clear it, leave this screen or next open Memoir, so save or share it first. There is no library of past archives to keep — prepare a fresh one whenever you want.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Memoir builds the archive on this device and hands it to you; nothing is uploaded. The copy waiting here is removed when you clear it, leave this screen or next open Memoir, so save or share it first. There is no library of past archives to keep — prepare a fresh one whenever you want."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Memoir couldn’t turn sync off, so nothing was erased. Try again, or turn sync off in Sync Settings first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
